// AstrBot Go plugin service contract.
//
// This is the RPC boundary between the AstrBot host process and a plugin
// running as a subprocess (go-plugin, gRPC flavor). Plugin authors do NOT
// touch this file directly; they implement the `sdk.Plugin` struct and call
